{
  "tema": 6230,
  "slug": "algo-pronombre",
  "titulo": "Algo: something, anything",
  "subtitulo": "¿Quieres algo?",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Algo means something, and anything in questions. It never changes form, and an adjective after it is masculine singular: algo rico. In negative sentences use nada instead: no quiero nada.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Algo** = _something_. In questions it also means _anything_: ¿Necesitas **algo**? (_Do you need anything?_)"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It **never changes**: no plural, no feminine. The verb is singular: **Algo** pasó."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "An adjective after it is **masculine singular**: **algo rico**, **algo nuevo**, **algo diferente**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "algo",
            "+ de +",
            "infinitive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Algo de comer**, **algo de tomar** = _something to eat, to drink_. **Algo más** = _something else, anything else_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In a **negative** sentence, _anything_ is **nada**: _I don't want anything_ = **No quiero nada**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **algo** is a closed box. You know something is inside, not what."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿Quieres ==algo== de tomar?",
              "en": "Do you want something to drink?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Tengo ==algo== para ti.",
              "en": "I have something for you."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Pasó ==algo==? Te ves preocupado.",
              "en": "Did something happen? You look worried."
            },
            {
              "es": "Vamos a comer ==algo== rico después de surfear.",
              "en": "Let's eat something tasty after surfing."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Les traigo ==algo== más?",
              "en": "Can I bring you anything else?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Quiero aprender ==algo== nuevo este año.",
              "en": "I want to learn something new this year."
            },
            {
              "es": "Hay ==algo== raro en este cuarto.",
              "en": "There's something weird in this room."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
